   "text": "Pack.summary_text() renders an \"## Already decided (existing insights)\" section when the pack carries\nINSIGHT notes. Insights are recorded ROUND BY ROUND \u2014 so if they ever reached the pack, the prefix\nwould change every round: byte-different, zero reads, no error anywhere.\n\nThey do not, because load_pack filters  node.get(\"type\") != INSIGHT  out of notes. That filter is the\nonly thing keeping the prefix stable, and nothing named it as load-bearing.\ntest_recorded_insights_do_not_drift_the_cached_prefix now pins it.",
   "originalText": "Pack.summary_text() renders an \"## Already decided (existing insights)\" section when the pack carries\nINSIGHT notes. Insights are recorded ROUND BY ROUND \u2014 so if they ever reached the pack, the prefix\nwould change every round: byte-different, zero reads, no error anywhere.\n\nThey do not, because load_pack filters  node.get(\"type\") != INSIGHT  out of notes. That filter is the\nonly thing keeping the prefix stable, and nothing named it as load-bearing.\ntest_recorded_insights_do_not_drift_the_cached_prefix now pins it.",
